# Pairs with ResizeCompletes. The fence step records nothing, so the flip,
# which waits for every captured shard to be fenced, is never enabled and the
# resize never finishes.
MODULE: ResizeCompletesFenceNeverLands
TARGET: ResizeCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the fence step records nothing, so the flip never becomes enabled
PERTURBS: ResizeFence

--- FIND
    /\ s \in rzShards \ fence
    /\ fence' = fence \cup {s}
--- REPLACE
    /\ s \in rzShards \ fence
\* MUTATION: EnterRejectingAsync has no effect.
    /\ fence' = fence
--- END
